{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"handbook.dependency-management.npm-supply-chain-cooldown","title":"Hardening npm dependency installs dengan cooldown policy","desc":"Panduan implementasi minimum release age, frozen lockfile CI, dan build script allowlist untuk mengurangi risiko supply chain di ekosistem npm/pnpm.","updated":1778773981913,"created":1778773660496,"tags":["handbook","dependency-management","security","supply-chain","pnpm"],"custom":{},"fname":"handbook.dependency-management.npm-supply-chain-cooldown","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"7b7267a2a44e6668c2213c3b75141214","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"handbook.dependency-management.npm-supply-chain-cooldown","id":"handbook.dependency-management.npm-supply-chain-cooldown","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.handbook","alias":"handbook","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.handbook"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"handbook.dependency-management.npm-supply-chain-cooldown","id":"handbook.dependency-management.npm-supply-chain-cooldown","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.dependency-management","alias":"dependency-management","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.dependency-management"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"handbook.dependency-management.npm-supply-chain-cooldown","id":"handbook.dependency-management.npm-supply-chain-cooldown","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.security","alias":"security","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.security"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"handbook.dependency-management.npm-supply-chain-cooldown","id":"handbook.dependency-management.npm-supply-chain-cooldown","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.supply-chain","alias":"supply-chain","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.supply-chain"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"handbook.dependency-management.npm-supply-chain-cooldown","id":"handbook.dependency-management.npm-supply-chain-cooldown","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.pnpm","alias":"pnpm","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.pnpm"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"handbook.dependency-management.npm-supply-chain-cooldown","id":"handbook.dependency-management.npm-supply-chain-cooldown","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.security.npm-supply-chain-cooldown-policy","position":{"start":{"line":113,"column":3,"offset":3460},"end":{"line":113,"column":54,"offset":3511},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.security.npm-supply-chain-cooldown-policy"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"handbook.dependency-management.npm-supply-chain-cooldown","id":"handbook.dependency-management.npm-supply-chain-cooldown","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.security.trusted-publishing-checklist","position":{"start":{"line":114,"column":3,"offset":3514},"end":{"line":114,"column":50,"offset":3561},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.security.trusted-publishing-checklist"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"handbook.dependency-management.npm-supply-chain-cooldown","id":"handbook.dependency-management.npm-supply-chain-cooldown","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.security.tanstack-postmortem","position":{"start":{"line":115,"column":3,"offset":3564},"end":{"line":115,"column":41,"offset":3602},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.security.tanstack-postmortem"}}],"anchors":{"kenapa-pakai-cooldown-policy":{"type":"header","text":"Kenapa pakai cooldown policy","value":"kenapa-pakai-cooldown-policy","line":16,"column":0,"depth":2},"kapan-policy-ini-cocok":{"type":"header","text":"Kapan policy ini cocok","value":"kapan-policy-ini-cocok","line":22,"column":0,"depth":2},"basic-setup-dengan-pnpm":{"type":"header","text":"Basic setup dengan pnpm","value":"basic-setup-dengan-pnpm","line":31,"column":0,"depth":2},"lapisan-ci":{"type":"header","text":"Lapisan CI","value":"lapisan-ci","line":45,"column":0,"depth":2},"tangani-package-internal-dan-darurat":{"type":"header","text":"Tangani package internal dan darurat","value":"tangani-package-internal-dan-darurat","line":59,"column":0,"depth":2},"build-script-allowlist":{"type":"header","text":"Build script allowlist","value":"build-script-allowlist","line":74,"column":0,"depth":2},"proses-operasional-yang-disarankan":{"type":"header","text":"Proses operasional yang disarankan","value":"proses-operasional-yang-disarankan","line":90,"column":0,"depth":2},"kelemahan-dan-trade-off":{"type":"header","text":"Kelemahan dan trade-off","value":"kelemahan-dan-trade-off","line":99,"column":0,"depth":2},"integrasi-dengan-supply-chain-defense":{"type":"header","text":"Integrasi dengan supply-chain defense","value":"integrasi-dengan-supply-chain-defense","line":106,"column":0,"depth":2},"catatan-penting":{"type":"header","text":"Catatan penting","value":"catatan-penting","line":115,"column":0,"depth":2},"related-resources":{"type":"header","text":"Related resources","value":"related-resources","line":125,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"ijpz6he1wpv1jrwe0s2ltp5","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"hardening-npm-dependency-installs-dengan-cooldown-policy\">Hardening npm dependency installs dengan cooldown policy<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#hardening-npm-dependency-installs-dengan-cooldown-policy\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"kenapa-pakai-cooldown-policy\">Kenapa pakai cooldown policy<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#kenapa-pakai-cooldown-policy\"></a></h2>\n<p>Serangan supply-chain npm sering menang di \"jendela waktu pertama\": versi baru dipublish, lalu project atau pipeline secara otomatis menginstal versi itu sebelum komunitas atau tooling sempat mendeteksi malicious release.</p>\n<p>Cooldown policy mengubah default behavior dependency manager dari \"ambil versi terbaru\" menjadi \"tahan dulu versi baru sampai cukup umur\".</p>\n<h2 id=\"kapan-policy-ini-cocok\">Kapan policy ini cocok<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#kapan-policy-ini-cocok\"></a></h2>\n<p>Gunakan ketika:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>repo punya jalur rilis sensitif atau produksi yang tidak boleh berubah otomatis</li>\n<li>project memakai agentic tooling, automation, atau workflow CI/CD yang sering install dependency</li>\n<li>tim perlu batasan update dependency baru tanpa memindahkan registry</li>\n<li>kamu ingin mencegah versi baru melewati pipeline hanya karena package manager default</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"basic-setup-dengan-pnpm\">Basic setup dengan pnpm<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#basic-setup-dengan-pnpm\"></a></h2>\n<p>Di <code>.pnpmrc</code> atau <code>pnpm-workspace.yaml</code>:</p>\n<pre class=\"language-yaml\"><code class=\"language-yaml\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">minimumReleaseAge</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">10080</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">minimumReleaseAgeStrict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean important\">true</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>Penjelasan:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>minimumReleaseAge: 10080</code> = versi package harus berumur minimal 7 hari sebelum pnpm boleh resolve.</li>\n<li><code>minimumReleaseAgeStrict: true</code> = policy ditegakkan keras; versi yang terlalu baru tidak akan dipilih.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"lapisan-ci\">Lapisan CI<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#lapisan-ci\"></a></h2>\n<p>Di pipeline CI, pakai:</p>\n<pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token function\">pnpm</span> <span class=\"token function\">install</span> --frozen-lockfile\n</code></pre>\n<p>Tujuan:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CI tidak resolve dependency baru sendiri</li>\n<li>build hanya menginstal apa yang sudah ada di lockfile</li>\n<li>dependency update harus masuk lewat PR terkontrol, bukan pipeline spontan</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"tangani-package-internal-dan-darurat\">Tangani package internal dan darurat<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tangani-package-internal-dan-darurat\"></a></h2>\n<p>Jika kamu punya package internal yang harus langsung dipakai, gunakan exception list:</p>\n<pre class=\"language-yaml\"><code class=\"language-yaml\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">minimumReleaseAgeExclude</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> nama<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>package<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>internal<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>elo\n</code></pre>\n<p>Aturan praktis:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>hanya exclude package yang kamu kendalikan secara penuh</li>\n<li>hindari daftar panjang exception</li>\n<li>dokumentasikan setiap pengecualian dan review periodik</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"build-script-allowlist\">Build script allowlist<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#build-script-allowlist\"></a></h2>\n<p>Install dependency npm bisa menjalankan kode melalui lifecycle script.</p>\n<p>Contoh policy ketat:</p>\n<pre class=\"language-yaml\"><code class=\"language-yaml\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">onlyBuiltDependencies</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> esbuild\n\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">allowBuilds</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token key atrule\">esbuild</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean important\">true</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>Ini cocok jika kamu ingin memastikan hanya dependency tertentu yang boleh menjalankan script build saat install.</p>\n<h2 id=\"proses-operasional-yang-disarankan\">Proses operasional yang disarankan<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#proses-operasional-yang-disarankan\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li>review dependency update lewat PR khusus</li>\n<li>pastikan versi baru memenuhi <code>minimumReleaseAge</code></li>\n<li>commit lockfile setelah resolusi selesai</li>\n<li>CI install dengan <code>--frozen-lockfile</code></li>\n<li>jika perlu package baru sebelum 7 hari, gunakan exception yang diaudit</li>\n<li>batasi build script kepada dependency terverifikasi</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"kelemahan-dan-trade-off\">Kelemahan dan trade-off<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#kelemahan-dan-trade-off\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><code>minimumReleaseAge</code> bisa menunda security patch baru; policy ini bukan freeze, tapi delay gate.</li>\n<li>exception list membuka celah kalau tidak dikelola.</li>\n<li>toolchain lain mungkin tidak mendukung policy yang sama; ini praktis untuk pnpm.</li>\n<li>butuh budaya dependency update yang lebih sadar, bukan hanya <code>pnpm install</code> terus jalan.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"integrasi-dengan-supply-chain-defense\">Integrasi dengan supply-chain defense<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#integrasi-dengan-supply-chain-defense\"></a></h2>\n<p>Cooldown policy ini efektif ketika digabungkan dengan:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>lockfile discipline (<code>commit lockfile</code>, <code>frozen lockfile</code> di CI)</li>\n<li>review update dependency lewat PR</li>\n<li>risk tiering package berdasarkan blast radius</li>\n<li>explicit build script allowlist</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"catatan-penting\">Catatan penting<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#catatan-penting\"></a></h2>\n<p>Policy ini bukan solusi yang menghilangkan semua risiko npm. Ia menambah lapisan yang murah dan mudah diterapkan:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>mencegah versi baru yang terlalu muda masuk otomatis</li>\n<li>membuat dependency update lebih sengaja</li>\n<li>memastikan CI hanya menjalankan dependency yang sudah dikunci</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Ini lebih ke \"friction-based security\" daripada \"security scan\".</p>\n<h2 id=\"related-resources\">Related resources<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#related-resources\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.security.npm-supply-chain-cooldown-policy\">NPM supply-chain cooldown policy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.security.trusted-publishing-checklist\">Trusted publishing: kritik argumen dan checklist operasional</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.security.tanstack-postmortem\">TanStack npm supply-chain compromise — postmortem notes</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">handbook (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">dependency-management (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">security (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">supply-chain (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">pnpm (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"name":"scratch","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd.HHmmss","addBehavior":"asOwnDomain"},"task":{"name":"","dateFormat":